import{_ as t,o,c as a,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 222 | Dao Integration Realm Deep Supplement: Initial Fusion with the Cosmic Law Network","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 222 | Dao Integration Realm Deep Supplement: Initial Fusion with the Cosmic Law Network","no":222,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Dao Integration Realm","Supplement","Law Fusion","Cosmic Law Network"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","20-Anchor Structure and Hierarchy","21-Symbiosis Network Operating Principles"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0222_模块1-合道境补遗-与宇宙法则网络初步融合.md","filePath":"en/0222_模块1-合道境补遗-与宇宙法则网络初步融合.md"}'),n={name:"en/0222_模块1-合道境补遗-与宇宙法则网络初步融合.md"};function r(s,e,l,h,u,c){return o(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-222-dao-integration-realm-deep-supplement-initial-fusion-with-the-cosmic-law-network" tabindex="-1">Entry 222 | Dao Integration Realm Deep Supplement: Initial Fusion with the Cosmic Law Network <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-222-dao-integration-realm-deep-supplement-initial-fusion-with-the-cosmic-law-network" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 222 | Dao Integration Realm Deep Supplement: Initial Fusion with the Cosmic Law Network&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 20, 21</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-from-my-dao-to-dao-is-me" tabindex="-1">Introduction: From &quot;my Dao&quot; to &quot;Dao is me&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-from-my-dao-to-dao-is-me" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: From &quot;my Dao&quot; to &quot;Dao is me&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Wanling Hengmao Origin Cosmos)&#39;s Dao Integration Realm is the four sacred-cultivation realms&#39; first realm, and also the true watershed between mortal and sacred cultivation. Dao Origin cultivators have a personal great Dao prototype, but that is still &quot;my Dao&quot;; Dao Integration requires personal Dao to deeply fuse with the cosmic law network, reaching the state where &quot;every move is in accord with Dao.&quot; This is not simple power enhancement, but <strong>fundamental transformation of existence mode</strong> — from &quot;cultivating in the cosmos&quot; to &quot;cultivating together with the cosmos.&quot;</p><p>The six top-level axioms manifest the most concentrated constraint in Dao Integration: the anti-predation axiom requires an integrated Daoist&#39;s Dao heart to be in sync with symbiotic laws, predatory Dao will inevitably reject at this realm; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires integrated Daoists&#39; power to serve Myriad Races; the collective ascension axiom requires integrated Daoists to lift Myriad Races along; the causal self-discipline axiom imposes the strictest constraint on integrated Daoists&#39; law operations; the law-first axiom ensures the fusion definition is stable and self-consistent; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This entry deep-dives Dao Integration&#39;s core mechanism: what exactly is &quot;initial fusion&quot; with the cosmic law network? What are the fusion&#39;s markers, process, and risks?</p><h2 id="i-what-is-the-cosmic-law-network" tabindex="-1">I. What Is the &quot;Cosmic Law Network&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-what-is-the-cosmic-law-network" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. What Is the &quot;Cosmic Law Network&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cosmos is not chaos, but a precise law network. This network is interwoven by countless laws, each law associated with and constraining every other law. Among the four-layer structure — material plane, energy layer, consciousness domain, law network — the law network is the bottommost operating-rules layer, governing all operations of the three upper layers.</p><p>Dao Integration&#39;s &quot;fusion&quot; is the cultivator&#39;s personal Dao producing <strong>structural docking</strong> with this law network — not &quot;using&quot; laws in the network, but &quot;becoming&quot; a living node in the network.</p><h2 id="ii-three-stages-of-fusion" tabindex="-1">II. Three Stages of Fusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-three-stages-of-fusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Three Stages of Fusion&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Name</th><th>Fusion State</th><th>Marker</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Stage 1</td><td>Dao-heart resonance</td><td>Personal Dao-rules resonate with cosmic laws</td><td>During cultivation can &quot;feel&quot; the law network&#39;s existence</td></tr><tr><td>Stage 2</td><td>Node docking</td><td>Personal Dao connects to the law network as a living node</td><td>Can mobilize law network resources in a larger range</td></tr><tr><td>Stage 3</td><td>Domain unfold</td><td>Personal domain stably takes shape, bidirectional interaction with the law network</td><td>Personal domain is the law network&#39;s extension</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="_2-1-dao-heart-resonance-stage" tabindex="-1">2.1 Dao-Heart Resonance Stage <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-dao-heart-resonance-stage" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.1 Dao-Heart Resonance Stage&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Fusion&#39;s first step is not technical operation, but <strong>Dao-heart sync</strong>. Dao Origin&#39;s personal great Dao prototype must fundamentally align with cosmic symbiotic laws — if personal Dao is predatory, it will produce &quot;frequency rejection&quot; with the symbiotic law network, no matter how strong the power, Dao Integration cannot be achieved.</p><p>This is why the mind-state dimension takes 25% in the four-dimensional assessment — Dao Integration is not &quot;power enough suffices,&quot; but &quot;Dao heart must be right.&quot; A cultivator harboring predation, even if power reaches Dao Integration standards, their Dao heart&#39;s rejection from cosmic symbiotic laws will prevent fusion; forced fusion only causes Dao-heart collapse.</p><h3 id="_2-2-node-docking-stage" tabindex="-1">2.2 Node Docking Stage <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-node-docking-stage" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.2 Node Docking Stage&quot;">​</a></h3><p>After Dao-heart sync, personal Dao begins structural docking with the law network. The cultivator no longer needs to &quot;deliberately call&quot; laws — their intent naturally connects to the network, law power responds like arms and fingers. Cultivators at this stage can rewrite local laws&#39; operation in a larger range, and their personal domain begins to stably take shape.</p><p>The node docking process is assisted throughout by the anchor network: anchor structure (Document 20) provides docking interfaces, the symbiosis network (Document 21) provides channel monitoring, ensuring the docking process does not damage the law network&#39;s overall stability.</p><h3 id="_2-3-domain-unfold-stage" tabindex="-1">2.3 Domain Unfold Stage <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-domain-unfold-stage" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.3 Domain Unfold Stage&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Fusion completion&#39;s marker is the stable unfold of the personal law domain. This domain is not a &quot;personal small world,&quot; but <strong>the law network&#39;s local extension</strong> — law operation within the domain is fully synchronized with the cosmic law network; cultivators in the domain can directly call network resources.</p><p>After Dao Integration&#39;s domain unfolds, the cultivator&#39;s life form begins evolving to higher dimensions, partially shedding material body constraints. Their consciousness can simultaneously operate on the material plane and the law network layer; perception range and response speed both undergo a qualitative leap.</p><h2 id="iii-risks-and-supervision-in-fusion" tabindex="-1">III. Risks and Supervision in Fusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-risks-and-supervision-in-fusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Risks and Supervision in Fusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao Integration&#39;s fusion process accompanies major risks, with the Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision intervening throughout:</p><ul><li><strong>Dao-heart rejection risk</strong>: when personal Dao rejects symbiotic laws, the system automatically halts fusion, guiding the cultivator to correct the Dao heart</li><li><strong>Network overload risk</strong>: personal domain unfolding too large may affect law network stability; the anchor network monitors in real time and limits domain expansion speed</li><li><strong>Law misoperation risk</strong>: integrated Daoists&#39; rewriting of laws must be filed in the anchor network; unfiled law rewriting auto-rolls back</li><li><strong>Karma disturbance risk</strong>: integrated Daoists&#39; law operations have large influence range; the causal self-discipline axiom requires all operations to be filed in advance</li></ul><h2 id="iv-social-role-of-dao-integration-realm" tabindex="-1">IV. Social Role of Dao Integration Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-social-role-of-dao-integration-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Social Role of Dao Integration Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao Integration cultivators are civilization&#39;s &quot;grandmasters,&quot; with important influence on civilization&#39;s development direction. Their social roles include:</p><ul><li><strong>Grand mentors</strong>: guiding Dao Origin and below cultivators&#39; Dao-rule distillation</li><li><strong>Law consultants</strong>: providing high-level theoretical support for civilization&#39;s law engineering</li><li><strong>Regional anchor guardians</strong>: responsible for maintaining one or more regional anchors&#39; stability</li><li><strong>Cross-system coordinators</strong>: coordinating law understanding differences among the three-hundred systems</li></ul><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Dao Integration fusion raises the cultivator&#39;s law invocation efficiency from Law Origin&#39;s about 40% to 80%+, eliminating intermediate loss</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Dao Integration&#39;s Dao-heart sync mechanism fundamentally excludes predators — predatory Dao and symbiotic law network naturally reject; forced Dao Integration inevitably fails</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo systems&#39; highest is only the &quot;fierce realm&quot; ceiling; Dao Integration in Heng Yuan Zhou is civilization grandmasters&#39; standard stage, the two are not on one dimension</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Dao Integration fusion is open to every Myriad Race group, each has its own integration way — energy life directly fuses with the energy law network, consciousness life fuses with consciousness-domain laws</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Dao Integration fusion methods, Dao-heart calibration tools, and docking protocols are all open, paving the way for Boundary-Breaking → World-Creation → Origin → higher realms</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao Integration&#39;s essence is not &quot;stronger,&quot; but &quot;larger&quot; — the cultivator&#39;s existence expands from the individual to the law network layer. In predatory-faction systems, &quot;Dao Integration&quot; often means &quot;my own Dao overrides everything,&quot; ultimately ending up alone; in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, &quot;Dao Integration&quot; means &quot;my Dao merges into the cosmic symbiotic Dao,&quot; ultimately leading to Myriad Races&#39; common prosperity. One does subtraction, one does multiplication; this is the fundamental difference of the first sacred-cultivation realm.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./20-锚点结构与层级.html">20-Anchor Structure and Hierarchy</a> · <a href="./21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiosis Network Operating Principles</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const g=t(n,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
